te_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-06-18T20:52:03Z","updated_at":"2020-06-18T20:52:03Z","body":"that makes sense because the execution mechanics have been completely rewritten.  however this issue would need a test added to verify.   ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/646299317/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/655464253","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4670#issuecomment-655464253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4670","id":655464253,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY1NTQ2NDI1Mw==","user":{"login":"RamonWill","id":56896136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODk2MTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56896136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill","html_url":"https://github.com/RamonWill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-07-08T11:38:04Z","updated_at":"2020-07-08T11:39:40Z","body":"Hey @zzzeek, \r\nI'm happy to create the test for this but just not sure what parameters I can use for execution_options on a Query Class on an sqlite database. From the docs i can see that this method can take in the same parameters as the Connection Class but i'm just not sure which ones i can use for a test.\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n@event.listens_for(Query, \"before_compile\", retval=True)\r\ndef _before_compile(query):\r\n    x =  query.execution_options(my_option=True)\r\n+   x.get_execution_options() # this will return immutable dict {my_option:True}\r\n    return x\r\n\r\n@event.listens_for(e, \"before_cursor_execute\", retval=True)\r\ndef _before_cursor_execute(conn, cursor, statement, parameters, context, executemany):\r\n    if context.execution_options.get(\"my_option\", False):\r\n        statement = \"-- my option found\\n\" + statement\r\n    return statement, parameters\r\n\r\n# no comment, no option\r\n+s.query(A).get_execution_options() # this will return an empty immutable dictionary\r\ns.query(A).all()\r\n```\r\nFrom debugging the code i can see that the execution options in _before_compile are used but they aren't bound to the global query, so when i perform get_execution_options() on the session query i get a blank immutable dictionary.\r\n\r\nAny guidance would be appreciated\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nRamon","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/655464253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"RamonWill","id":56896136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODk2MTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56896136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill","html_url":"https://github.com/RamonWill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3524783052,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MzUyNDc4MzA1Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/events/3524783052","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-07-08T11:38:05Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":3524783054,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDM1MjQ3ODMwNTQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/events/3524783054","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-07-08T11:38:05Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/655540028","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4670#issuecomment-655540028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4670","id":655540028,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY1NTU0MDAyOA==","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-07-08T14:01:50Z","updated_at":"2020-07-08T14:01:50Z","body":"hi @RamonWill -\r\n\r\nin this case, the execution option only needs to take effect when the SQL statement is executed, which is what we intercept within the before_cursor_execute event.   it won't be copied out to the outermost Query as you've observed.\r\n\r\nso how we test these things is by collecting what we see inside of before_cursor_execute and asserting that.  I usually use the mock library to gather data like this, although a plain Python list/dict can work too, likely better in this case:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import column\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import create_engine\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import event\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import Query\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import Session\r\n\r\ne = create_engine(\"sqlite://\", echo=True)\r\n\r\n\r\n@event.listens_for(Query, \"before_compile\", retval=True)\r\ndef _before_compile(query):\r\n    return query.execution_options(my_option=True)\r\n\r\n\r\nopts = {}\r\n\r\n@event.listens_for(e, \"before_cursor_execute\")\r\ndef _before_cursor_execute(\r\n    conn, cursor, statement, parameters, context, executemany\r\n):\r\n    opts.update(context.execution_options)\r\n\r\ns = Session(e)\r\ns.query(column('1')).all()\r\n\r\nassert opts[\"my_option\"] == True\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/655540028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3525384293,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MzUyNTM4NDI5Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/events/3525384293","actor":{"login":"RamonWill","id":56896136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODk2MTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56896136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill","html_url":"https://github.com/RamonWill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RamonWill/followers","following_url":"h